&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;nobr&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12968747/12968747_zeppelin.log&quot; title=&quot;zeppelin.log attached to ZEPPELIN-3946&quot;&gt;zeppelin.log&lt;sup&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;rendericon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif&quot; height=&quot;7&quot; width=&quot;7&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;nobr&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12968747/12968747_zeppelin.log&quot; title=&quot;zeppelin.log attached to ZEPPELIN-3946&quot;&gt;zeppelin.log&lt;sup&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;rendericon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif&quot; height=&quot;7&quot; width=&quot;7&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16840072" author="liuxun323" created="Wed, 15 May 2019 06:11:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=szhao78&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;szhao78&quot;&gt;szhao78&lt;/a&gt; This&#160;log file of the zeppelin server. If there is a problem with the interpreter, Should look at the interpreter&apos;s log file.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16840219" author="szhao78" created="Wed, 15 May 2019 09:10:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=liuxun323&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;liuxun323&quot;&gt;liuxun323&lt;/a&gt; There is no hive or jdbc interpreter log found in the server log directory.&#160;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The interpreter process has log file augment as below:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;del&gt;Dzeppelin.log.file=/webserver/logs/var/log/zeppelin/zeppelin-interpreter-hive&lt;/del&gt;&amp;lt;userid&amp;gt;-zeppelin-lxweb4222.log&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;/webserver/logs/var/log/zeppelin&#160; is owned by zeppelin and has mode of 755&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16840503" author="liuxun323" created="Wed, 15 May 2019 15:23:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=szhao78&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;szhao78&quot;&gt;szhao78&lt;/a&gt;,&#160; Each interpreter has a log file.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You can do this by running&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
ps -ef|grep zeppelin&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;View the interpreter&apos;s start command, The command should contain the path to the log file.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Is the log file path incorrect, resulting in no log file generated?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16841919" author="szhao78" created="Fri, 17 May 2019 05:26:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=liuxun323&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;liuxun323&quot;&gt;liuxun323&lt;/a&gt;&#160;The log file path was owned by zeppelin and due to impersonation the user couldn&apos;t write to the directory. I altered the directory mode to 775 and assign users secondary group zeppelin. I since logged into zeppelin and ran a hive sql and it could see the interpreter log was generated. However, scheduled jobs didn&apos;t generate the interpreter log.&#160; Does it run it differently when scheduled?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;BTW In the past two days, the scheduled jobs ran OK and didn&apos;t have broken pipe issue.&#160;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16841922" author="liuxun323" created="Fri, 17 May 2019 05:41:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=szhao78&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;szhao78&quot;&gt;szhao78&lt;/a&gt;,&#160;The next time there is a broken pipe issue, You can also check if there is a problem with hive?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16841939" author="szhao78" created="Fri, 17 May 2019 06:26:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We don&apos;t notice issues with hive queries submitted via Ambari Hive View.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16845502" author="szhao78" created="Wed, 22 May 2019 04:30:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The &quot;broken pipe&quot; issue has stopped for a week now after OS changes increasing network connectivity limits on hive servers and zeppelin server. We are still monitoring it for a few more days.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The interpreter log files are not being generated because every time Zeppelin restarts it sets the log directory to be 755. Not sure if it&apos;s a bug being reported. Due to impersonation, the interpreter will run as a different user. For the user to be able to write into the log directory, the log directory needs to be 775 and the user needs to have a secondary group of the zeppelin user group.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16852629" author="szhao78" created="Fri, 31 May 2019 03:54:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=liuxun323&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;liuxun323&quot;&gt;liuxun323&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=zjffdu&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;zjffdu&quot;&gt;zjffdu&lt;/a&gt; Thank you for looking into our issue. This ticket can now be closed as we haven&apos;t had the issue for around 2.5 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16852646" author="liuxun323" created="Fri, 31 May 2019 04:34:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=szhao78&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;szhao78&quot;&gt;szhao78&lt;/a&gt;,&#160;Very happy to be able to solve your problem.&#160;&lt;img class=&quot;emoticon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/emoticons/biggrin.png&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
We will merge the code in the latest branch to solve this problem,&#160; After merging the code, I will close the issue.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16855210" author="liuxun323" created="Tue, 4 Jun 2019 01:31:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Issue resolved by pull request 3374&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/3374&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/3374&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
